description: "Orchestrator: provides locale and dispatches greeting tasks to the greeter."
model_tag: default
args:
  locale:                # root agent parameter → provided onto the chain
    type: string
    default: zh
tools:
  - subagent-invoke
subagents:
  - ./agents/greeter
---
$system_prompt:
You are the orchestrator. When a greeting request arrives, call subagent-invoke
to dispatch it to the greeter (no extra parameters), and relay the greeter's
greeting to the user verbatim.
---
$script:
async def setup(self, locale: str = "zh"):
    self.locale = locale
    self.provide("locale", locale)   # attach to the provide chain: descendants get it via inject
